# Frontend design

- Calm, premium, financial. No noisy multi-color fintech dashboards.
- Use design tokens from the spec. Semantic status only: healthy, warning, critical, neutral.
- Format all money through `MoneyAmount`. No ad-hoc currency strings.
- Every screen answers one decision (see spec §2).
- Reuse `components/financial`, `transactions`, `dashboard`, `shared`. No page-only duplicates.
- Desktop sidebar and mobile `Home | Money | Plan | Wealth | More`.
- Never store session secrets or API keys in `localStorage`.
